# The deploy scripts run on Linux, and scripts/deploy.sh is piped straight into
# `sh` over ssh. A CRLF checkout makes them fail on the first line with an error
# naming a command that does not exist — the carriage return having become part
# of its name. Cheap to pin, and it costs nothing here because these files are
# new.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
Caddyfile text eol=lf
